      "text": "Police identified firearm brandishing individual in road accident viral video  in Taguig-Makati Border.\n\nBrig. Gen. Rodecindo Reales identified during a press briefing held at Camp Crame, Mr. Joey Sabando, a protection agent which was in the viral video seen brandishing a firearm while ordering the pick-up truck driver to surrender.\n\nMoreover, PNP spokesperson, Brig. Gen. Randulf Tuaño said also during the press briefing that the protection agent surrendered voluntarily to Makati City Police as well as his firearm and IDs. | via Vince Lopez\n\n📸: PNP/Screengrab",
